@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Disclaimer | D2DJobs";
    ViewData["MetaDescription"] = "Read the D2DJobs disclaimer and important notice regarding job information and advertisements.";
}

<div class="container py-5 legal-page">

    <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
    <p class="muted">Last updated: 30 September 2026</p>

    <p>
        The information provided on D2DJobs is for general informational
        and educational purposes only.
    </p>

    <h3>Job Information</h3>

    <p>
        We collect and share job openings from company websites, recruiters,
        career portals, and publicly available sources. While we try to keep
        information accurate and updated, we do not guarantee job availability,
        recruitment confirmation, interview calls, or hiring results.
    </p>

    <h3>User Verification</h3>

    <p>
        Users are strongly advised to independently verify all company details,
        eligibility criteria, salary information, deadlines, and official
        application links before applying for any job opportunity.
    </p>

    <h3>External Links</h3>

    <p>
        Our website may contain links to external company websites, recruitment
        portals, or third-party platforms. D2DJobs is not responsible for
        the content, privacy practices, security, or services provided by
        external websites.
    </p>

    <h3>No Recruitment Guarantee</h3>

    <p>
        D2DJobs is not a recruitment agency and does not guarantee
        employment, interview selection, or placement opportunities.
    </p>

    <h3>Advertisements</h3>

    <p>
        D2DJobs may display third-party advertisements including Google
        AdSense ads. We are not responsible for products, services, offers,
        or claims made by advertisers.
    </p>

    <h3>General Career Information</h3>

    <p>
        Career resources provide general preparation ideas. They are not individual career, legal, financial, or
        professional advice, and they do not replace current employer instructions or advice tailored to a person's circumstances.
    </p>

    <h3>Consent</h3>

    <p>
        Third-party advertising is controlled by protected site settings and should remain disabled
        until the site owner has configured and verified any consent mechanism required for the audience.
        The readiness checkbox in the admin area does not itself install a consent platform, and using
        the site does not by itself confirm consent to personalized advertising.
    </p>

    <h3>Contact</h3>

    <p>
        If you have questions regarding this disclaimer, please contact us
        through our Contact page.
    </p>

</div>
